{"id":"432be048cd519891","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","title":"Submanifold","display":"df-submanifold — Submanifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-submanifold","aliases":["58-df-submanifold","Submanifold"],"display":"df-submanifold — Submanifold","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-submanifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-submanifold</span><span>Submanifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-submanifold — Submanifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k\\in V\">\\(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k\\in V\\)</span> (subset, carrier, topology, atlas, and dimensions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atlas}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Atlas}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (chosen smooth-manifold data, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_M\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau_M\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_M\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_M\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau_M\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_M\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embedded\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\land k\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq m\\land S\\subseteq M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in S\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(p\\in U\\land\n\\phi[U\\cap S]=W\\cap\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^m:\\forall i\\in m\\setminus k\\;x(i)=0\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embedded\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\land k\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq m\\land S\\subseteq M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in S\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(p\\in U\\land\n\\phi[U\\cap S]=W\\cap\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^m:\\forall i\\in m\\setminus k\\;x(i)=0\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m\\;\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m\\;\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_k(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_k(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Regular submanifold: embedded via definition by regular values or preimage theorem</li>\n<li>Immersed submanifold: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> is immersion but not necessarily embedding; image may self-intersect</li>\n<li>Preimage theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: M \\to N\">\\(f: M \\to N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q \\in N\">\\(q \\in N\\)</span> regular value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies f^{-1}(q)\">\\(\\implies f^{-1}(q)\\)</span> is embedded submanifold of codim <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim N\">\\(\\dim N\\)</span></li>\n<li>Tubular neighborhood: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\subseteq M\">\\(S \\subseteq M\\)</span> has open neighborhood diffeomorphic to normal bundle</li>\n<li>Frobenius: integrable distribution defines foliation by submanifolds</li>\n<li>The data predicate exposes the topology, atlas, ambient dimension, and submanifold dimension; the projected predicate forgets only chosen witnesses.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atlas}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,m)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_M\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau_M\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_M\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle,\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(U\\cap V\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty(\\phi[U\\cap V],\\psi[U\\cap V])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embedded\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldData}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\\land k\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq m\\land S\\subseteq M\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in S\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(p\\in U\\land\n\\phi[U\\cap S]=W\\cap\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^m:\\forall i\\in m\\setminus k\\;x(i)=0\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m\\;\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(S,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submanifold\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_k(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,M,k)","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"f: M \\to N","display":false},{"tex":"q \\in N","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies f^{-1}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim N","display":false},{"tex":"S \\subseteq M","display":f